### 1. 模糊查询人员列表
POST {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByFuzzy
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "status": 1,
  "personTypeList": ["1", "2"],
  "fullName": "李江",
  "montage" : "or",
  "jobNo": "01320003"
}

### 2. 新增人员
