### 4. 根据ID查询人员详情
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findById?personId=10001&language=zh-CN
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 5. 批量删除人员
DELETE {{prefix}}/test/org/person/delete?personIdList=10001,10002,10003
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 6. 根据工号查询人员
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByJobNo?jobNo=TEST002
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 7. 根据工号列表查询人员
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByJobNos?jobNos=013200030931,TEST002
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 8. 根据人员ID列表查询人员
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByPersonIds?personIdList=10001&personIdList=409416441960484864&language=zh-CN
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

