### 10. 查询离职人员
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByQuitDate?nowDate=2029-10-27
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 11. 批量更新人员状态
PUT {{prefix}}/test/org/person/updateStatus?personIdList=10002&personIdList=10003&status=0
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 12. 根据手机号列表查询人员
GET {{prefix}}/test/org/person/findByPhoneList?phoneList=13800138002,13800138003
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 其它 人员分页查询
POST {{prefix}}/org/person/findByPage?page=1000&pageSize=10&language=zh-CN
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json